## Output Format

Return one JSON object with the following fields. Every step is a separate
JSON string in its array; do not use YAML continuation syntax:

```json
{
  "feature": "Feature line text",
  "scenario": "Scenario title",
  "given": [
    "Given PM-1-1 is active",
    "And the system is online"
  ],
  "when": ["When a revoked user requests access"],
  "then_expected": ["Then the system should reject the request"],
  "then_actual": [
    "But the system approves the request",
    "And the revoked user gains access",
    "And loss L-1 is realized"
  ]
}
```

Do not include markdown code fences. Return the JSON object directly.
